WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:05.040
So, the summer break you've all 
been waiting for starts tomorrow.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.060
Yay!

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.940
So predictable.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.950
Naturally, you're getting homework!

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.490
Aww...

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:17.090
Your summer homework will 
be to clear several quests

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:19.250
and turn in a report on at least one.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:22.310
Quests are our summer homework, huh?

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:24.380
I wonder what the options are.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.490
Let's look at them together later and decide.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:27.880
Right, Yusha?

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.140
Yusha!

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.260
Wh-What is it?

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.340
It looked like you were spacing out.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.180
Were you thinking about something?

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.890
Well, I was just really looking 
forward to summer break!

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.780
I was thinking about where 
we should go together!

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.960
How brave of you to discuss your plans for 
fun while I'm talking about your homework.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:51.530
Huh?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.720
I'm looking forward to your homework.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.840
Endro!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.500
Roll 4
 

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.510
Summer break homework, huh?

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.040
What should we do?

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:41.420
Thanks to you, Mao-sensei raised the bar on us.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:44.580
We won't be able to get by 
with regular homework.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:47.420
I'm sorry!

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:48.770
I'm joking.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:55.340
Gathering medicinal herbs, mining 
ore, collecting monster eggs...

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.240
There's a lot here. Which to choose?

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.180
I know! Defeating the Demon Lord!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:02:59.940
Not an option.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:02.020
I know! Eat delicious food!

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.210
No, that's a goal.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.560
I know! Complete my rare Cartado collection!

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.000
That's just your wish.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:09.120
I've got it! Let's go to the beach!

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:10.500
The beach?

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.500
Yeah!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.050
You've got to go to the beach in the summer!

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:16.260
Beach, beach, beach, beach, beach!

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.260
The beach, huh?

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.630
<i>The beach? There's fresh fish 
and shellfish at the beach!</i>

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.010
<i>It's a chance to get Cartado that 
are exclusive to port towns!</i>

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.980
I'm all for the beach!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.980
I agree!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.530
I bet you two just think
you can eat seafood

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:30.660
and buy Cartado at the port, don't you?

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.900
Can we, Seira-chan?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.390
If we're going to play, I'm against it.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:37.230
But...

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.400
If we're going on a quest, I'm in.

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:43.180
Investigating the monsters
 living on a remote island?

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:44.780
Sounds fun!

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:45.780
Well?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.290
Then we're taking this one!

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.930
If we're going on a journey,
 we'll need Cartado for camping gear.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:56.140
I-I won't bring the wrong one again!

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:57.170
Okay, Fai?!

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.720
They're okay.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.880
They haven't expired yet.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.300
Wait! You can't eat them now!

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:09.600
Yusha-san, what's the matter?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.440
Huh?

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.390
Well, I've thought this before,

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.570
but preparing for an adventure 
like this is fun, isn't it?

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.570
It is.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.670
Oh! I'll check Sei-chan's preserved food, too!

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:26.910
Huh?! No, no, no! Stop!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.720
We're here!

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.480
Let's go play now!

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.370
Let's play!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:37.020
You know we shouldn't!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:39.750
We came here on a quest.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:43.480
As representatives of all adventurers,
 we need to investigate and report

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:46.660
on the monsters living on this island—hmm?

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:51.160
When did you...

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.410
Aren't you getting changed, Seira-chan?

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.460
I told you! We didn't come 
here to play around!

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.980
You brought a swimsuit, didn't you?

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.170
Well, of course I did, but...

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:03.520
I'll help you!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.090
I... I can get changed by myself.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.450
I might have been a bit too indulgent.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.110
Yes, yes, you've eaten too many snacks.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.560
Mei-chan, if you do that, it's war!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.570
You look cute in your swimsuit, Sei-chan!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:29.880
What's the matter?

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:32.950
Sei-chan!

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:37.330
Don't stand next to me!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.340
Anyway!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.210
Remember, we're here on a quest!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.810
So let's each start 
investigating the monsters!

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.290
Okay!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.490
The monsters around here are...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.570
What a pretty shell.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.320
It'll make a great souvenir.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:05.730
Huh?

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.100
Sei-chan, what's wrong?

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.450
This shell won't budge.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.180
Just leave that to me!

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:19.220
You okay?

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:23.000
Looks like I'm going to have 
to get serious with this one.

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.600
Heave-ho!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.510
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.640
Wow, what's that? Amazing!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:38.770
Tip of the Iceberg Shell

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:38.770
It's a monster that lives on sandy beaches:
the tip of the iceberg shell.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:42.390
If you think it's just a small shell 
and kick it, it hurts like crazy.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.270
Are you taking it home as a souvenir?

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.780
I'm giving up on that.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.060
Let's make it even bigger!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:07:59.910
Roger!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.190
I knew they'd start playing around.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.200
What's wrong?!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.240
What's the matter?

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.800
Huh?! What the heck?!

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:15.300
My castle's been taken over by a hermit crab!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.810
That's a monster known as a lodging hunter.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.810
Lodging Hunter

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.320
It's a nasty creature that looks for a place

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:25.100
that can serve as a nest, then captures 
it by force and settles into it.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.700
My Royal Yusha Castle!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.320
You named it?

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.460
Well, it <i>was</i> a sand castle.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.070
Of course it'd crumble.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.960
Royal Yusha Castle!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.210
Where's the watermelon?

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.460
Yu-chan, to your right! Right!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.540
Oh, you went too far.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.140
A little to the left.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.710
They're totally playing around.

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.810
Wait, are there more of them?

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.560
Could that be...

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:07.850
There are more!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:09.140
What's going on?

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.340
That's a watermelon mimic.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:17.070
Watermelon Mimic

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:13.880
It's a troublesome monster 
that appears on beaches.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:17.070
It divides when cut by a sword!

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:19.140
In that case, I'll hit it!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.270
Oh, wait!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.080
When you hit it, it grows bigger.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.210
Then what if I attack it with magic?

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.530
Foul being, face the judgment of light!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.910
Banisher!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.910
By the way, it reflects magic,
so you absolutely can't use that.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.100
Say that sooner!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.660
I can't believe swords and 
magic won't work on it.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:47.880
It's invincible.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.980
Not really.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.480
Horned gorillas are way cooler.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.320
Mentally, these guys are pushovers.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.540
Wow.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.040
First there was the tip of the iceberg shell,

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.160
then the lodging hunter, right?

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:10.200
And also the watermelon mimic...

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:13.070
There are so many of types
 of monsters just on the beach!

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.220
Seriously.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:16.500
But thank goodness we had Mei.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.050
You really know a lot 
about monsters, Mei-chan.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.800
Yeah!

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.560
Encyclopedia of Dangerous Beach Monsters

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.200
All right! Homework complete!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.500
Now, it's about time we...

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.880
Eat, right?!

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:29.860
Yeah!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:31.690
Well, shall I prepare it, then?

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:34.440
Huh?

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.020
This one's no good.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.100
This one's no good.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:38.560
And this one, and this one, too...

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:39.730
They're all empty!

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.200
What's going on?!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:44.520
Oh! Maybe...

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.750
that's the reason?

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.340
That's obviously the reason!

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:54.590
Mei, do you have any preserved food Cartado?

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.710
Nope!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.840
How is that something to smile about?!

00:10:58.440 --> 00:10:59.970
I'm sorry.

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:03.370
All this summer freedom is getting to me.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.600
There's nothing we can do if it's been eaten.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.500
We have to look toward 
the future, not the past.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.790
We need to secure food somehow.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.240
Yeah.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:17.740
Of the Cartado we can use,
the one that looks most helpful is...

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.240
This!

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.340
Let's go fishing!

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.300
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.040
This is my first time fishing!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.420
Mine, too.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.540
Seira-san, what are you doing?

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.020
Oh, I got a bite!

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:49.560
I did it!

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.680
You both caught side dishes, I see!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.410
Yusha, that's incredible.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.400
Here I go!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.920
You're using a casting net?!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:09.040
She's serious!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.910
She's serious about catching fish!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.920
Grilled with salt, simmered, served raw!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.550
I caught a mackerel!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.930
Wait! You caught something 
incredible over there!

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.230
We'll simmer this one in miso.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:30.430
You're gonna eat it?!

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.160
It's getting up!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.940
Please help me!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.630
It spoke!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:44.000
We spend our lives
 traveling the ocean, mackerel.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.200
You're a fish, so you migrate, right?

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:51.300
There's a rest stop we visit every year 
when we come around here, mackerel.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:53.460
But that's where it all happened, mackerel.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.590
Be my woman, mackerel.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.840
Oh, but, mackerel...

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:01.860
Mackerel!

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.080
I won't let you go, mackerel.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.220
Oh, mackerel.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.220
Mackerel?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.660
Mackerel!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:24.300
We never knew there was an evil god
 sealed within our rest stop, mackerel.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.870
The seal broke because you were flirting?

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:30.740
All my friends have been captured 
by the evil god, mackerel.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.180
I'm sure they're suffering 
right now, mackerel.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.910
Please, will you help us, mackerel?

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:37.060
Slaying an evil god?

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.900
That sounds super heroic!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:43.340
Looks like Yu-chan's entered 
Hero mode already.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:45.190
That's not surprising.

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:49.600
Everyone, let's defeat the evil god 
and save the mackerelmen!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.430
Yeah!

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:53.560
Thank you all so much, mackerel!

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:57.310
Well, let's go to the undersea temple!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.490
But how do we get there?

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:00.870
It's in the ocean, right?

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.110
Mei-chan, do you know a way?

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.450
Of course.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:08.090
This is the time for Cartado to shine!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:09.650
Its name is...

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:11.900
the Waterbreathing Cartado!

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:12.610
Hah!

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:59.650
You have been granted the honor 
of building an evil god's temple!

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:02.090
Be grateful for this duty!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.190
Sabami-chan!

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:08.660
Hey, you! No slacking off!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.280
Who are you?!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.350
Squid!

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:16.970
Sabami-chan!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.100
Are you hurt, mackerel?

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.100
Oh, you came to save me, mackerel.

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.670
You're all right now, mackerel.

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.480
Yusha... You're talking like them.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.100
More importantly, where's the evil god?

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.810
In that temple, mackerel.

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:33.740
The evil god is conducting a ritual
 to resurrect completely, mackerel.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.870
If he's able to regain all his power,
 this world is finished, mackerel.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:41.120
Don't worry! Leave it to us!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.430
Where's the evil god?

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:53.440
Be careful, Yusha.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.560
It's too dark. I can't see.

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:57.040
Want to turn on a light?

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.290
Who dares to obstruct my prayers?

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.400
So you're the evil god?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.050
We'll make you pay for making 
those mackerelmen work for you!

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.150
That's right!

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:16.950
Sometimes in life,
 you just don't want to work!

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:22.810
All creation has belonged to me 
since the genesis of this world.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.760
Thus, all obey my will.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:29.840
You show hubris, puny beings.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:32.850
Huh? What did he say?

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.120
He used a lot of difficult words.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.810
Seira-san, did you understand?

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:37.660
Huh?!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:42.880
Uh, everything has been 
his since long, long ago,

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:44.970
so everyone does as he wants.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:47.920
And we're all getting full 
of ourselves... I think?

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.320
I see!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.060
Seira-chan, you're incredible!

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:51.700
Huh?

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:56.720
But he didn't need to go out of his 
way to use such complicated words.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.090
That's true.

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:00.750
Pretty cocky for someone who was sealed away.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.250
Insolence!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.940
Surprise attacks are cowardly!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:14.260
Silence! You must wish to cast away 
your lives by setting foot in my temple!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.530
Very well.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:20.580
Before I destroy the world, 
I shall destroy all of you!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.520
Magic Shield!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.020
Thanks, Seira-chan!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.180
Mei-chan, backup, please!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.060
On it!

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.500
Fai-chan, let's go!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.280
Yeah!

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.780
Lightning, strike my enemy!

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.030
Lightning Arrow!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.910
Annoying!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.970
You're mine!

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:41.980
Huh?!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:43.160
Begone!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.790
Fai-chan!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:47.620
Know your place, lowly adventurers!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:51.430
I am fated to destroy this world,

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:55.410
so only those who also bear the fate
 of this world can wound me!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:59.050
In other words, 
only that despicable Hero can!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.550
Now, die!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.710
A futile struggle.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:08.270
What?!

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.170
Impossible!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.440
That light...

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:19.310
Why does one such as you 
possess the Hero's sword?!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:21.860
Because I'm the Hero!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.610
Curse you!

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:32.960
Evil god slaying quest, complete!

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.730
Well, shall we go home?

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:37.820
The Mackerelmen should be happy now, too.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:40.480
And we can finish our homework, 
so it's two birds with one stone.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:49.980
Do they think that was enough to destroy me?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.660
Even the Hero is nothing 
more than a little girl!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.500
This is my true form!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.530
Now there is none who can rival me!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:00.660
Not even the Demon Lord!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.120
There's a fish bone stuck in my throat!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:15.420
I will cover the whole world in
the darkness of fear and despair!

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:27.740
What's going on here?!

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:30.220
The whole world has been 
consumed by darkness?!

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:34.300
Burp.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.150
Thank you so much, mackerel.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.210
Now we can migrate through the 
ocean in peace again, mackerel.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:52.160
This is all thanks to you four, mackerel.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:55.590
We'll never forget the name 
of the Hero Yusha, mackerel.

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.750
You're making me blush.

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:02.880
I hope you'll, um, find happiness
 with your girlfriend now.

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:05.600
Huh? What?

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.970
Look over there.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.980
Mackerel...

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.130
I'm so happy, mackerel.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:11.980
Me too, mackerel.

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:14.800
Wh-What's going on?

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.220
They supported each other 
while they were captured.

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.290
That brought them closer 
together, apparently.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.620
It's the bridge effect in play.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:22.980
I'm so sorry!

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:24.200
It's fine, mackerel.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.740
I'll find a better girlfriend, mackerel.

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.620
He's so strong.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:38.520
After a battle comes good food!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:42.740
It's good because it's fresh.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.390
We're still cooking more up!

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.180
Oh, Chibi-chan!

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.610
Where have you been?

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:52.660
Today we defeated an evil god, 
and now we're having a fish party!

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:54.180
See? Here!

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:56.400
Burp.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:01.060
Huh? I guess you're already full...

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.490
That was delicious.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.650
I'm full.

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:07.380
I can't eat any more.

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:08.850
Me neither.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:12.540
Everyone, thank you for today.

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:16.620
Not just for going along with 
my desire to visit the beach,

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.300
but for helping me save 
the mackerelmen, too!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:23.020
Seira-chan, we were able to come 
to this island because you insisted

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:24.620
that we take on a quest at a beach.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:28.260
And we found out the evil 
god was going to revive

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.710
thanks to Fai-chan
 catching the mackerelman.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.420
Without Mei-chan's Cartado, 
we wouldn't have

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:35.940
been able to go into the 
sea to fight the evil god.

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:39.370
I think we really did something heroic today!

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.800
So thank you, everyone!

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.500
What are you talking about, Yusha?

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.770
That's right! It was only natural!

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:49.140
Exactly.

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:51.360
We're your friends, aren't we?

00:21:51.360 --> 00:21:52.770
And members of Yusha's party.

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:57.830
Yeah! And I hope we'll stay that way!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.540
Of course!

00:21:58.210 --> 00:21:59.540
Yeah!

00:21:58.550 --> 00:21:59.540
Sure!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
My Hero!

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.220
"My Hero!"
